# Protected explicit --env-file overrides after a valid --config JSON.
# This file contains references and policy values only; never credential contents.
# Copy only required keys to a mode0600 operator file. Unknown, duplicate, empty,
# malformed and contradictory values fail. There is no shell or ambient env expansion.
# All keys require a process/service restart; use the same file for fenced cleanup.

# Purpose/owner: agent control_origin; string, string.
# Permitted: nonempty string satisfying the owning profile/path/image contract; omitted retains valid JSON; required fields must already be configured.
# No literal secrets; image pins must match verified manufacturing receipts.
# Mapping/precedence: this explicit key overrides JSON control_origin; restart required.
# PROJECT_ONE_AGENT_CONTROL_ORIGIN=https://admin.example.invalid

